@startuml
title C16 CI and code scanning workflows
' Traces: OMCT-C16-L2-02.04, OMCT-C16-L2-02.05
actor "Workflow event" as Event
participant "PR workflow" as PRWorkflow
participant "CodeQL workflow" as CodeQLWorkflow
participant "Dependency build/cache job" as DependencyJob
participant "Quality jobs" as QualityJobs
participant "CodeQL analysis" as CodeQL

Event -> PRWorkflow: trigger pull-request workflow
activate PRWorkflow
PRWorkflow -> DependencyJob: build and cache dependencies
activate DependencyJob
DependencyJob --> PRWorkflow: dependencies available
deactivate DependencyJob
PRWorkflow -> QualityJobs: run lint, unit, sharded e2e, visual-a11y, performance, memory
activate QualityJobs
QualityJobs --> PRWorkflow: job results
deactivate QualityJobs
PRWorkflow --> Event: PR workflow result
deactivate PRWorkflow

Event -> CodeQLWorkflow: trigger push, pull-request, or weekly schedule
activate CodeQLWorkflow
CodeQLWorkflow -> CodeQL: initialize JavaScript security-and-quality queries
activate CodeQL
CodeQL --> CodeQLWorkflow: initialized
CodeQLWorkflow -> CodeQL: autobuild
CodeQL --> CodeQLWorkflow: autobuild complete
CodeQLWorkflow -> CodeQL: perform analysis
CodeQL --> CodeQLWorkflow: analysis result
deactivate CodeQL
CodeQLWorkflow --> Event: CodeQL workflow result
deactivate CodeQLWorkflow
@enduml
